TI  - A specific primed immune response in Drosophila is dependent on phagocytes
AN  - 17352533
DO  - 10.1371/journal.ppat.0030026
IS  - 3
VL  - 3
DA  - 2007/03
PY  - 2007
JO  - PLoS pathogens
J2  - PLoS Pathog
SN  - 1553-7366
